            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the countries displayed distinct patterns, with Canada experiencing dramatic fluctuations while the other nations showed more gradual trends. Canada began with the highest satisfaction rate but ended in the middle range by 2007, whereas the US consistently recorded the lowest levels throughout the period.</p>",
            "question_id": 17111,
